#X text 4600 2520 The breadcrumb's reading half: u_init writes recover and a stamp before the reload \, so the next boot reports it. The arming override lands at 2000 \, sending live \, so every knob is live after an emergency. The report and the clear wait until 4500 \, clear of the boot stages. Cleared by overwriting with a one-line sentinel \, since vanilla Pd cannot delete a file \; text set takes a list \, hence list none (ref/module/map.md)., f 44;
