#X text 3700 1540 diag summons g_oled's diagnostic layer. The spigot is the same non-zero test as every button. The diagnostics page's first pad names it (item 301)., f 62;
#X text 3000 180 A Launchpad CC button sends 127 then 0 \, so these gates stop each selection firing twice. They cannot go above the route: og-key releases there are real note-offs (item 293). C-8, f 62;
